$DIR/test.p:4:9: invalid operation: x (variable of type int) is not an interface
    A type assertion x.(T) asks which concrete type an interface value holds, so
    x must be an interface. This value is not an interface; its type is already
    known.
    (see "Type assertions" in the Plutonium spec, section 11.13)
    (run "pluto explain E0094" for a longer explanation)
